{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvaZUJNsJzoSo2LchXNx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: plan to sunset the integration. Rebuild only if a quick check shows the four accounts carry meaningful revenue and have no alternative.**\n\n**The numbers**\n- Rebuilding costs about 30 engineer-days. Maintenance at 2 days a month would take 15 months to add up to that, but maintenance isn't the real alternative. The old API dies in five months, so the real choice is rebuild or sunset.\n- Four of 3,100 accounts is 0.13% of the base. Sunsetting also ends the 2 days a month of upkeep.\n- Six weeks of an engineer is hard to justify for that usage unless those accounts are large or strategic.\n\n**On the PM's proposal**\nInterviews are cheap and fine, but \"would you like us to rebuild this?\" will get a \"yes\" from almost anyone. Do a desk check first, using data you already have:\n1. ARR and renewal dates for the four accounts, and whether any are tied to a larger deal.\n2. How deeply they use the integration. Is it core to their workflow or occasional?\n3. Whether the 90-day window hides seasonal or dormant users. Check 12 months.\n4. Whether a substitute exists, such as generic SMTP/IMAP, Gmail/Outlook integrations, or a CSV or webhook path.\n\nThen talk to the accounts. Ask what they'd do if the integration went away, and what it would cost them. Don't ask what they want.\n\n**Timing**\nA six-week build plus buffer means the decision must be made by about month two, so the interviews can't drag. If the four are low-value and have alternatives, announce the sunset early and offer migration help. If one is large enough to justify the six weeks, rebuild, but treat it as a retention cost against that account's revenue."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3611,"cache_read_input_tokens":4609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3611},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04b144b1-ab6f-4a06-b709-a7cda94f313d","uuid":"c5d950b5-979a-4538-82ae-1a64dd75dc72","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:07:11.250Z","request_id":"req_011CfvaZU22A43bTXKsjNKGc"}
